of companies that Serves Its Customers through One or more Of these Brands:</div></div><div class=\"w-layout-layout wf-layout-layout\" id=\"w-node-_4fbc66f4-a1fa-1f5b-dd95-bb4f632dbe00-f1cb0610\"><div class=\"w-layout-cell\"><div class=\"white-box\" data-w-id=\"270e8437-efa3-df11-d438-de69b23e41e9\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img alt=\"Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage logo\" class=\"image-3\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66a9673e9869f0d967e95aaf_Bailey%27s%20Moving%20and%20Storage%20Logo%20Blue%20and%20Orange.svg\" width=\"Auto\"/><h3 class=\"heading\">Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage</h3><p>Moving and storage services for families moving locally, between states, and around the world. since 1952. Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage is an Agent for Allied Van Lines.</p><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://www.baileysallied.com\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Site</a></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-cell\"><div class=\"white-box\" data-w-id=\"c6639f04-f287-7a41-a9ed-41386b2c0ac9\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img alt=\"Bailey's Logistics logo\" class=\"image-4\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66a9678324928082e5812539_BL-PRIMARY-logo-horizontal-RGB.svg\"/><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Bailey's Logistics</h3><p>Skilled logistics for businesses needing domestic or international services including transportation, warehousing, final mile, and more.</p><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://baileyslogistics.com\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Site</a></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-cell\"><div class=\"white-box\" data-w-id=\"29c25774-570b-ddb2-69b5-f4ddbb194afd\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img alt=\"Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage Workplace logo\" class=\"image-4\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66a969b7713fa26c95619f83_bms-workplace-logo-full-color-rgb.svg\"/><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Bailey's Moving &amp; Storage: Workplace</h3><p>Custom moving solutions for businesses. Office moving, relocations, custom projects, inventory management, installations and more.</p><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://www.baileysallied.com/services/office-industrial\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Site</a></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-cell\"><div class=\"white-box\" data-w-id=\"c8cbaecc-7479-cdc5-2503-439ddc2cc3f4\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img alt=\"Legacy Transportation Systems logo\" class=\"image-4\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 83vw, 216.84375px\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu.png\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu-p-2600.png 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66a811178a7051a0f1cb05d8/66abbf881872ed1e53959e04_legacytrans%20blu.png 3383w\"/><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Legacy Transportation Systems</h3><p>Freight Transportation for customers in the United States needing  dry van, lift gate and more.  Asset-based logistics services for businesses needing high-reliability.</p><a class=\"button-2 w-button\" href=\"https://baileyslogistics.com/transportation\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Site</a></div></div></div></div></div>",
